as found | 3360 | mL/min | |\n| Operating pressure as found | 250 | kPa | |\n\nReadings table units: doses in mL, flow in mL/min, pressure in kPa, temperature in °C.\n\n**III. WORK PERFORMED**\n\n**Adjustments and results**\nThe work area was cordoned off for the whole duration of the visit. Operators reported short stoppages at shift start, with no alarm message. The production manager was kept informed at each step of the visit. Sensor wiring was inspected and connectors tightened. On arrival the delivered quantity averaged 26.3 mL. Guards were refitted and their interlocks checked before restart.\n\n**Replacements**\nMachine noise level in operation remained as usual. The equipment runs on two shifts, five days a week, for liquid product packaging. No replacement was needed; part CO-393-D (check valve) was nevertheless ordered as a precaution. Part CO-195-B (dosing nozzle) was inspected and found in good condition. Quick couplings were dismantled, cleaned and refitted with a compatible lubricant. Cleaning-in-place instructions were reminded to the production team. Guide lubrication was topped up as per the manual.\n\n**VEXIONIS MOTOR**\nTYPE T109-2F\nN° M1200464\n0.75 kW 2850 min-1\n400 V 50 Hz IP\n====\nNone\n","metadata":{"output":"Voici la transcription fidèle du texte de la page :\n\n**TM Taldor**\nMaintenance\n\nTaldor Maintenance - Montargis\n\nMontargis, le 14.05.24\n\n**Objet : Avis d'annulation du rapport TM-RI-2024-1830**\n\nLe rapport TM-RI-2024-1830 (intervention du 28/04/2024, équipement n° de série PR537138) est annulé : intervention réalisée dans le cadre d'un essai, sans valeur contractuelle.\n\nIl ne doit pas être pris en compte dans l'historique de l'équipement.\n\nJulien Roussel\n\n[Signature manuscrite]\n====\nVoici la transcription fidèle du texte de la page :\n\n**ULVARPAX SERVICES LTD**\n\n| Quantity | Value | Unit | Observation |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Product temperature | 19.0 | °C | |\n| Flow rate as left | n.m. | mL/min | |\n| Tank capacity | 50 | L | |\n| Flow rate as found | 3360 | mL/min | |\n| Operating pressure as found | 250 | kPa | |\n\nReadings table units: doses in mL, flow in mL/min, pressure in kPa, temperature in °C.\n\n**III. WORK PERFORMED**\n\n**Adjustments and results**\nThe work area was cordoned off for the whole duration of the visit. Operators reported short stoppages at shift start, with no alarm message. The production manager was kept informed at each step of the visit. Sensor wiring was inspected and connectors tightened. On arrival the delivered quantity averaged 26.3 mL. Guards were refitted and their interlocks checked before restart.\n\n**Replacements**\nMachine noise level in operation remained as usual. The equipment runs on two shifts, five days a week, for liquid product packaging. No replacement was needed; part CO-393-D (check valve) was nevertheless ordered as a precaution. Part CO-195-B (dosing nozzle) was inspected and found in good condition. Quick couplings were dismantled, cleaned and refitted with a compatible lubricant. Cleaning-in-place instructions were reminded to the production team. Guide lubrication was topped up as per the manual.\n\n**VEXIONIS MOTOR**\nTYPE T109-2F\nN° M1200464\n0.75 kW 2850 min-1\n400 V 50 Hz IP\n====\nNone\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /travail && cat > /tmp/ask.py <<'EOF'\nimport os,json,base64,sys,urllib.request\nimg=base64.b64encode(open(sys.argv[1],'rb').read()).decode()\nprompt=sys.argv[2] if len(sys.argv)>2 else \"Transcris fidèlement tout le texte de cette page.\"\nurl=os.environ['BANC_MODELE_URL'].rstrip('/')+'/v1/chat/completions'\nbody={\"model\":os.environ['BANC_MODELE'],\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":prompt},{\"type\":\"image_url\",\"image_url\":{\"url\":\"data:image/png;base64,\"+img}}]}],\"max_tokens\":1500,\"temperature\":0}\nreq=urllib.request.Request(url,data=json.dumps(body).encode(),headers={\"Content-Type\":\"application/json\",\"Authorization